# Supabase
# Copy this file to .env in the project root. Restart Expo after you change it.
# Expo inlines any variable that starts with EXPO_PUBLIC_.
#
# Leave both values empty to use the on-device local session
# (src/lib/auth/local-session.ts). The app boots and the main flows work
# without a Supabase project. Nothing is sent to Supabase.
#
# Set both values to use Supabase Auth and Postgres. Sign-in, intake
# responses, domain scores, badge progress, reflections, and the current
# rank are stored for that user. The app does not fall back to the local
# session while these are set. Do not put the service role key here.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
